  </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>Görüntü
  ve diğer verilerin kablosuz alımı ve aktarımı (örn: SMS, MMS, e-mail, vb.);<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;
  mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;
  mso-list:l2 level1 lfo15'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
  font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><span
