  </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>Mikrofon
  ve hoparlör;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;
