  </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>Seramik
  uzak infrared ısıtıcı<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
  margin-left:22.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;
